  ],
  "note": "LOCO-CERT-ART. The artillery is the infantry's short-sword soldier until the guns have their own model (army_models.tres binds it to infantry.tscn), so this is the infantry's provider and config at the artillery's footprint radius 875 and its own scale; stride_m 1.765 is the infantry's MARCH measurement, now the artillery row's too. Map3DInfantryLocomotion re-solves the coupled pivot plan for each grid turn. Pivots enter and leave MARCH at 13/14 only and the hold is MARCH frozen at 13/14 (owner ruling A, a consumer requirement). Stance comes from the certifier's per-foot planting band. turn_q 400000 is the contract's example value: a LOCO-POLICY row with another turn_q means re-running this certificate. Any real gun model voids it. Re-issued 2026-11-16 for the short-sword soldier (new infantry.glb, MARCH stride 1.618, k 25.8437, contact 23217 um).",
